    "id": "f6hnmjoumfswp31h2d1sunjl",
    "text": "Paragraph with heading\n\nIs Light a Wave, a Particle, or Both?\n\nFor centuries, scientists have debated the true nature of light. Is it a wave, a particle, or something else entirely? Understanding how light behaves isn’t just a question for physicists—it shapes the technology we use every day, from cameras to solar panels. In this lesson, you’ll explore the evidence that has led to our modern understanding of light’s dual nature and see how scientific models help us make sense of the world.\n\n+"
  },
