    "id": "bgrt7lpzpfxpn43dxxsagynn",
    "text": "Paragraph with heading\n\nEvidence for Wave-Particle Duality\n\nHow do we know that light behaves as both a wave and a particle? In this section, you’ll examine key experiments and observations. You’ll test different models against real phenomena and see which explanations hold up to the evidence.\n\n+"
  },
