    "text": "Paragraph\n\nNow that you’ve explored how evidence shapes our understanding of light, you’ll investigate how similar reasoning helps us understand the structure and transformations of atomic nuclei. Get ready to apply evidence-based thinking to the heart of the atom in the next lesson!\n\n+"
